@ 33.3.2.2.4 - Valley Yokuts to Chukchansi
# citation: CatDoom, from Whistler, Kenneth W., and Golla, Victor (1986), “Proto-Yokuts Reconsidered”. International Journal of American Linguistics Vol. 52, No. 4 (Oct. 1986) /s ʃ ʂ/ may be a single alternating phoneme
	ʈ ʈʰ ʈʼ > t͡ʃ t͡ʃʰ t͡ʃʼ
	t͡ʃ t͡ʃʰ t͡ʃʼ > t͡s t͡sʰ t͡sʼ